{"id":"BkiUf67xK6nrxjHzEKMd","content":"|}\n|}\nDe Zweedse weg 130 (Zweeds: Länsväg 130) is een provinciale weg in de provincie Kalmar län in Zweden en is circa 8 kilometer lang. De weg ligt in het zuiden van Zweden.\n\nPlaatsen langs de weg \n Torsås\n Söderåkra\n\nKnooppunten \n Europese weg 22 bij Söderåkra (einde)\n\n130\nLansvag 130","ad_en":[-3.26171875,4.01171875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":4.729166666666667,"fineweb_edu":[0.8568344116210938],"modernbert_readability":[-6.25,0.265869140625,0.2130126953125,1.3828125,3.501953125,-0.0361328125],"qurater":[-3.740234375,-3.044921875,-1.0380859375,-2.974609375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":4.405286343612335,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.3171955,"dsir_math":-522.5086363,"dsir_wiki":-520.79664652,"rps_doc_num_sentences":3,"rps_doc_word_count":48.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-2.5,7.11328125,5.1171875,0.054290771484375,-2.658203125,-5.9453125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":67.85714285714286,"fluency_en":[0.94482421875,-0.56005859375],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":31.707317073170728,"dsir_books":-527.00073233,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-7.45703125,-8.5234375,6.05859375,5.21875,6.50390625,-8.609375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":27.406190300927147,"modernbert_reasoning":[7.48046875,11.2109375,2.013671875,-5.48828125,-5.8984375,-5.75],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":30.76923076923077,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":17.111875018501525,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUanzxK6Ot9Pm3s-L8","content":"Montancy is een gemeente in het Franse departement Doubs (regio Bourgogne-Franche-Comté) en telt 148 inwoners (2004). De plaats maakt deel uit van het arrondissement Montbéliard.\n\nGeografie \nDe oppervlakte van Montancy bedraagt 9,1 km², de bevolkingsdichtheid is 16,3 inwoners per km². De gemeente grenst in het oosten aan Zwitserland.\n\nDemografie \nOnderstaande figuur toont het verloop van het inwonertal (bron: INSEE-tellingen).\n\nExterne links \n \n\nGemeente in Doubs","ad_en":[-3.482421875,4.14453125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.921875,"fineweb_edu":[1.7597978115081787],"modernbert_readability":[-6.45703125,-1.1953125,-0.1729736328125,1.697265625,4.0390625,0.81201171875],"qurater":[-2.923828125,-2.35546875,-0.66943359375,-2.142578125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":5.277044854881266,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.68370575,"dsir_math":-697.40740194,"dsir_wiki":-691.10696735,"rps_doc_num_sentences":6,"rps_doc_word_count":64.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-2.486328125,8.34375,5.90625,-0.0543212890625,-3.384765625,-6.5546875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":72.3076923076923,"fluency_en":[-0.84326171875,0.89306640625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":22.69807280513919,"dsir_books":-695.36550608,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-7.5703125,-7.1171875,4.484375,4.3125,8.0859375,-6.2734375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":37.723169943648024,"modernbert_reasoning":[6.8984375,10.90625,2.26171875,-4.890625,-5.60546875,-5.890625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":66.66666666666666,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.0952699634312484,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
