{"id":"BkiUdlU5qg5A56rhK9-r","content":"Reicheia demirei is een keversoort uit de familie van de loopkevers (Carabidae). De wetenschappelijke naam van de soort is voor het eerst geldig gepubliceerd in 2009 door Grebennikov, Bulirsch & Magrini.\n\ndemirei","ad_en":[-3.068359375,3.517578125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.612903225806452,"fineweb_edu":[0.6116542220115662],"modernbert_readability":[-4.57421875,2.478515625,0.9970703125,2.0625,1.7890625,-2.408203125],"qurater":[-1.876953125,0.03076171875,1.5009765625,-0.63623046875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":5.747126436781609,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.12095299,"dsir_math":-354.87914748,"dsir_wiki":-339.29813172,"rps_doc_num_sentences":3,"rps_doc_word_count":31.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.9140625,0.0021820068359375,3.177734375,2.7734375,1.2265625,-2.82421875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":80.64516129032258,"fluency_en":[-0.1192626953125,0.23046875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":19.811320754716974,"dsir_books":-339.35546964,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-10.84375,-11.609375,5.453125,3.048828125,10.25,-5.62109375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":34.318555008210176,"modernbert_reasoning":[8.46875,10.234375,0.908203125,-5.4375,-5.73046875,-6.0234375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":66.66666666666666,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.0204081632653061,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUa7LxaJJQnJ5kSpA5","content":"Izturis is the surname of two Venezuelan brothers, who both play in Major League Baseball:\n\nCésar Izturis (born February 10, 1980), baseball shortstop\nMaicer Izturis  (born September 12, 1980), baseball infielder","ad_en":[-3.46484375,4.1953125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.516129032258065,"fineweb_edu":[0.5067558884620667],"modernbert_readability":[-7.9375,-3.263671875,-4.58984375,0.60400390625,4.5546875,6.32421875],"qurater":[-3.03125,-2.390625,1.6435546875,-2.15234375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":12.865497076023392,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.13191422,"dsir_math":-364.55361916,"dsir_wiki":-337.72557347,"rps_doc_num_sentences":1,"rps_doc_word_count":31.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.6796875,11.2578125,6.5703125,-0.9775390625,-4.8828125,-7.45703125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":81.25,"fluency_en":[-3.00390625,2.908203125],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":25.94339622641509,"dsir_books":-356.10532132,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-11.6640625,-10.65625,4.68359375,-0.71240234375,8.59375,-0.487548828125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":28.911500533886063,"modernbert_reasoning":[10.3515625,11.2109375,0.560546875,-5.78125,-7.13671875,-7.02734375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":25.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":7.207792207792208,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdUA5qg5A56rhKtl0","content":"Park Kultury (ryska: Комсомо́льская, \"Kulturparken\") är en tunnelbanestation på Sokolnitjeskajalinjen i Moskvas tunnelbana. Stationen ligger nära nöjes- och kulturparken Gorkijparken i centrala Moskva.\n\nPark Kultury är en av de stationer som öppnades i det första steget av tunnelbanan i Moskva, den 15 maj 1935. Stationen är en trespanns pelarstation i två våningar, med fyra gångbroar ovanför plattformarna. Arkitekterna Krutikov och Popov inspirerades av antik grekisk arkitektur, längs plattformen står två rader marmorpelare krönta av gjutna kapitäl. Längs väggarna finns pilastrar, klädda i mörkt rosa mosaik. Gångbroarna har gjutna vita balustrader och marmorräcken. Väggarna i korridorerna som leder till vestibulerna är klädda i vit marmor.\n\nByten \nPå Park Kultury kan man via rulltrappor byta till Park Kultury-stationen på ringlinjen.\n\nSe även \n Moskvas tunnelbana\n Lista över Moskvas tunnelbanestationer\n\nExterna länkar \n\nMoskvas tunnelbanestationer\nJärnvägsstationer invigda 1935\n1935 i Sovjetunionen","ad_en":[-1.6630859375,1.865234375],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.470588235294118,"fineweb_edu":[1.270232915878296],"modernbert_readability":[-6.8046875,-3.400390625,-1.4365234375,-0.5,5.078125,4.83984375],"qurater":[-0.1923828125,-0.60791015625,0.293212890625,-1.0087890625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":3.75,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.3606663,"dsir_math":-1245.8389056,"dsir_wiki":-1244.19637192,"rps_doc_num_sentences":10,"rps_doc_word_count":136.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.326171875,3.458984375,3.990234375,2.349609375,-1.2587890625,-5.01171875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":66.66666666666666,"fluency_en":[-0.58642578125,0.38134765625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":22.408687068114503,"dsir_books":-1238.79444299,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-6.3984375,-4.98046875,4.015625,3.46484375,5.296875,-4.47265625],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":35.64487335011839,"modernbert_reasoning":[-2.498046875,7.546875,5.8398437