{"id":"BkiUbbY5qsJBjjX4VM-_","content":"Il Governo della Spagna è regolato secondo il Titolo IV della Costituzione della Spagna approvata nel 1978 e anche secondo il Titolo V della legge del governo. La Spagna è una monarchia parlamentare, dove è presente un re (Filippo VI), che ricopre il ruolo di capo dello Stato, e un presidente del Governo (Pedro Sánchez Pérez-Castejón), che esercita il potere esecutivo.\n\nAltri progetti\n\nCollegamenti esterni","ad_en":[-3.42578125,4.16015625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.2,"fineweb_edu":[1.233675241470337],"modernbert_readability":[-6.85546875,-1.677734375,-0.475830078125,1.33203125,4.5703125,2.203125],"qurater":[-1.3330078125,1.9091796875,-1.0244140625,-1.5126953125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":6.508875739644971,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.68519275,"dsir_math":-670.96686724,"dsir_wiki":-665.24840829,"rps_doc_num_sentences":3,"rps_doc_word_count":65.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.337890625,4.7265625,5.02734375,2.00390625,-1.7060546875,-5.48046875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":70.58823529411765,"fluency_en":[-1.619140625,1.544921875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":21.271393643031786,"dsir_books":-665.07019472,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.8203125,-8.953125,8.03125,4.10546875,8.53125,-7.3203125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":43.56064690026954,"modernbert_reasoning":[3.36328125,9.546875,3.892578125,-3.265625,-5.3515625,-5.7109375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":8,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":60.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.36429872495446264,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdDA5qhLBCSMaND51","content":"Oroxenofrea spiculata is een keversoort uit de familie van de boktorren (Cerambycidae). De wetenschappelijke naam van de soort werd voor het eerst geldig gepubliceerd in 1999 door Galileo & Martins.\n\nBoktorren","ad_en":[-3.318359375,3.75],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.766666666666667,"fineweb_edu":[1.047729730606079],"modernbert_readability":[-4.88671875,2.9140625,0.8974609375,2.296875,1.83984375,-2.8515625],"qurater":[-2.02734375,0.76220703125,1.6201171875,-0.619140625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":5.780346820809249,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.12393851,"dsir_math":-340.58007511,"dsir_wiki":-326.22599652,"rps_doc_num_sentences":3,"rps_doc_word_count":30.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.62109375,1.1298828125,3.6328125,2.810546875,0.323486328125,-3.41796875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":83.33333333333334,"fluency_en":[-0.1292724609375,0.350341796875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":19.138755980861248,"dsir_books":-327.6124381,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.953125,-11.65625,3.873046875,2.533203125,11.2734375,-4.609375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":37.87878787878788,"modernbert_reasoning":[5.1796875,9.8203125,3.251953125,-3.841796875,-5.15625,-5.72265625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":66.66666666666666,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.0416666666666665,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUd_k5qYVBjbaaWCyH","content":"A Miner's Romance er en amerikansk stumfilm fra 1914.\n\nMedvirkende \n Murdock MacQuarrie som Bob Jenkins.\n Agnes Vernon som Lucy Williams.\n Lon Chaney som John Burns.\n Seymour Hastings som Dave Williams.\n\nReferencer\n\nEksterne henvisninger \n\n \n\nStumfilm fra USA\nAmerikanske film fra 1914","ad_en":[-3.3515625,3.875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.675,"fineweb_edu":[0.5688061714172363],"modernbert_readability":[-5.5,2.791015625,1.5205078125,2.634765625,1.6904296875,-4.171875],"qurater":[-1.7587890625,-2.15625,0.1873779296875,-3.265625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":9.691629955947137,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.36388202,"dsir_math":-453.09565222,"dsir_wiki":-446.35945827,"rps_doc_num_sentences":6,"rps_doc_word_count":40.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.546875,6.69140625,4.36328125,-0.264892578125,-2.404296875,-5.62890625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":80.0,"fluency_en":[0.84326171875,-0.08770751953125],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":23.15789473684211,"dsir_books":-444.85944469,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.609375,-7.63671875,7.7265625,4.9296875,7.140625,-10.5234375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":38.11587375325583,"modernbert_reasoning":[8.0078125,10.03125,0.87109375,-4.984375,-6.203125,-6.30859375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":68.75,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":2.384313725490196,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdko4eIOjRzejrljC","content":"Cmentarz żydowski w Czudcu – kirkut znajdujący się w Czudcu w dzielnicy Okop przy ul. Rzeszowskiej. Cmentarz zajmuje powierzchnię 0,37 ha, znajduje się na nim jeden fragment nagrobka.\n\nCmentarz został założony na przełomie XVIII i XIX wieku. Podczas II wojny światowej hitlerowcy doszczętnie zdewastowali nekropolię. Po zakończeniu wojny cmentarz służył jako teren rolniczy. Teren jest nieogrodzony. Fragmenty nagrobków można znaleźć w korycie potoku przepływającego nieopodal cmentarza.\n\nZobacz też \n Synagoga w Czudcu\n Mykwa w Czudcu\n\nPrzypisy\n\nBibliografia \n \n \n \n Mapa WIG Błażowa Pas 49 Słup 34 Warszawa 1938\n\nLinki zewnętrzne \n Cmentarz żydowski w Czudcu na portalu Wirtualny Sztetl\n\nCmentarze żydowskie w województwie podkarpackim\nArchitektura judaizmu w Czudcu\nObiekty sakralne w Czudcu","ad_en":[-2.1953125,2.3515625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.296296296296297,"fineweb_edu":[1.1486459970474243],"modernbert_readability":[-5.8984375,-0.8505859375,0.806640625,0.7314453125,2.943359375,0.78564453125],"qurater":[-1.498046875,-0.331787109375,0.97607421875,-0.5244140625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":7.205882352941176,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.18643284,"dsir_math":-995.38025432,"dsir_wiki":-982.8994277,"rps_doc_num_sentences":9,"rps_doc_word_count":108.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.697265625,2.20703125,3.19921875,2.453125,-0.1612548828125,-4.0234375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":76.42276422764228,"fluency_en":[-0.84814453125,0.634765625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":22.418136020151138,"dsir_books":-991.53238603,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-7.47265625,-5.93359375,7.9375,8.1953125,5.08203125,-11.046875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":32.241543089651564,"modernbert_reasoning":[1.6279296875,7.97265625,3.765625,-2.228515625,-4.34765625,-4.91015625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":5,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":50.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.4638960469323976,"sub_path":"","_sou