{"id":"BkiUbPE4uBhhxNKuBvEe","content":"La classe America è una categoria di navi portaeromobili d'assalto (LHA), composta da 11 unità, di cui 2 già in servizio e 1 in costruzione per la United States Navy (USN).\n\nUnità\n\nAltri progetti\n\nCollegamenti esterni \n \n \n \n\nAmerica","ad_en":[-2.890625,3.501953125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":4.918918918918919,"fineweb_edu":[0.7358365058898926],"modernbert_readability":[-6.44921875,2.806640625,1.189453125,2.828125,2.38671875,-2.625],"qurater":[-3.02734375,0.1461181640625,0.60888671875,-2.06640625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":0.0,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.42358084,"dsir_math":-409.71419748,"dsir_wiki":-400.25378726,"rps_doc_num_sentences":2,"rps_doc_word_count":37.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.388671875,4.6015625,4.96484375,1.392578125,-1.595703125,-5.08984375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":83.78378378378379,"fluency_en":[-1.1416015625,1.205078125],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":27.038626609442062,"dsir_books":-403.92537974,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.0390625,-3.912109375,10.15625,5.88671875,3.654296875,-11.390625],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":37.7154854189738,"modernbert_reasoning":[4.63671875,10.703125,3.5078125,-3.904296875,-5.7109375,-5.99609375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":66.66666666666666,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.47904191616766467,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUddg5qWTBC2ZBhmG6","content":"Анче Џамбазова (Скопље, 3. март 1942 — Скопље, 30. септембар 1997) је била југословенска и македонска филмска и позоришна глумица. Анче Џамбазова је ћерка глумца Петра Прличког, супруга компизитора Александра Џамбазова и мајка шоумена Игора Џамбазова.\n\nФилмографија \n\n|- style=\"background: Lavender; text-align:center; \"\n| colspan=\"4\" |1960.-те\n|-\n| 1961. || Мирно лето || Заба (као Анче Прличкова)\n|-\n| 1967. || Да видам, да видам што да бидам ТВ мини серија || /\n|-\n| 1969. || Свекник ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1969. || Прозори ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1969. || Сеништа ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1969. || Лукава удовица ТВ филм || /\n|- style=\"background: Lavender; text-align:center; \"\n| colspan=\"4\" |1970.-те\n|-\n| 1970. || Нешто веома деликатно ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1970. || Ветар во кутиче кибрит ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1972. || Вртлог ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1974. || Средба ТВ филм || Малина\n|-\n| 1974. || Брачна понуда ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1975. || Волшебното самарче ТВ серија || Танејица\n|- style=\"background: Lavender; text-align:center; \"\n| colspan=\"4\" |1980.-те\n|-\n| 1982. || Едно лето ТВ серија || /\n|-\n| 1984. || Комедијанти ТВ серија || Кјерката на газдата\n|-\n| 1984. || Хихирику - 5 години ТВ филм || /\n|-\n| 1985. || Сомнително лице ТВ филм || Марица\n|-\n| 1987. || Чорбаџи Теодос ТВ филм || Наца\n|-\n| 1988. || Втора смена ТВ серија || Готвацката\n|-\n| 1988 1989. || Тврдокорни ТВ серија || /\n|- style=\"background: Lavender; text-align:center; \"\n| colspan=\"4\" |1990.-те\n|-\n| 1991. || Македонија може ТВ серија || /\n|-\n| 1988 1992. || Македонски народни приказни ТВ серија || /\n|-\n| 1994-1995. || Бумбари ТВ серија || Лилјана\n|-\n| 1995. || Во светот на бајките ТВ серија || /\n|-\n| 1994 1997. || Македонски народни приказни 2 ТВ серија || /\n|}\n\nСпољашње везе \n \n\nРођени 1942.\nУмрли 1997.\nМакедонски глумци\nЈугословенски глумци\nСкопљаци","ad_en":[-2.740234375,3.197265625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.6028708133971294,"fineweb_edu":[0.895973265171051],"modernbert_readability":[-5.859375,-0.2998046875,0.4541015625,1.107421875,2.671875,0.0019969940185546875],"qurater":[-2.984375,-2.67578125,-2.4609375,-4.00390625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":6.148590947907771,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.38836293,"dsir_math":-3446.10645292,"dsir_wiki":-3455.05872776,"rps_doc_num_sentences":35,"rps_doc_word_count":209.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.90234375,3.724609375,3.501953125,1.1494140625,-1.1005859375,-3.783203125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":58.65384615384615,"fluency_en":[0.98388671875,-0.86328125],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":90.03873824017708,"dsir_books":-3445.79085072,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.015625,-6.05078125,5.41796875,2.82421875,5.515625,-4.01171875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":9.452438045168481,"modernbert_reasoning":[4.60546875,9.2109375,2.982421875,-4.3984375,-5.7265625,-5.55859375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":12,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":17.142857142857142,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":14.474189324274683,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdl_xK0wg09KOXUFG","content":"Obelia longissima är en nässeldjursart som först beskrevs av Peter Simon Pallas 1766.  Obelia longissima ingår i släktet Obelia och familjen Campanulariidae. Arten är reproducerande i Sverige. Inga underarter finns listade i Catalogue of Life.\n\nKällor\n\nExterna länkar \n\nHydrozoer\nlongissima","ad_en":[-3.705078125,4.30078125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.25,"fineweb_edu":[0.9259730577468872],"modernbert_readability":[-6.671875,-0.1917724609375,-0.1414794921875,1.5341796875,3.791015625,0.06488037109375],"qurater":[-3.08984375,0.385498046875,1.3291015625,-0.59130859375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":12.8,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.40703433,"dsir_math":-435.35162519,"dsir_wiki":-436.73802859,"rps_doc_num_sentences":5,"rps_doc_word_count":40.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-4.08984375,1.3955078125,3.96484375,2.41015625,0.413818359375,-3.5390625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":79.16666666666666,"fluency_en":[-1.357421875,1.302734375],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":20.689655172413794,"dsir_books":-437.31054454,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-6.609375,-6.0625,5.7265625,6.6171875,5.8515625,-8.8203125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":42.42283950617284,"modernbert_reasoning":[2.478515625,11.125,4.94921875,-3.73046875,-5.39453125,-6.1484375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":50.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.32786885245901637,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdzU5qhDBZQiepNjD","content":"Emily Chancellor (born 20 August 1991) is an Australian rugby union player. She plays in the Loose Forwards for Australia and the NSW Waratahs in the Super W competition.\n\nBiography \nChancellor made her international debut for the Wallaroos on 18 August 2018 against New Zealand in a Bledesloe double header at the ANZ Stadium in Sydney. She was named Wallaroos Player of Year in 2018.\n\nChancellor was named in the Australian squad for test matches against Fiji and Japan in May 2022. She was then named in the squad for the 2022 Pacific Four Series. She started against the Black Ferns in the opening match of the Pacific Four series on 6 June.\n\nChancellor also made the Wallaroos squad for the two-test series against the Black Ferns for the Laurie O'Reilly Cup. She was selected in the team again for the delayed 2022 Rugby World Cup in New Zealand.\n\nReferences\n\nExternal links\nWallaroos Profile\n\nLiving people\nAustralia women's international rugby union players\nAustralian female rugby union players\n1991 births","ad_en":[-3.6171875,4.0234375],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":4.887573964497041,"fineweb_edu":[0.7427148818969727],"modernbert_readability":[-8.3125,-4.98046875,-3.388671875,-1.546875,6.953125,8.4140625],"qurater":[-0.638671875,-1.6865234375,1.7021484375,0.51708984375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":3.631961259079903,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.13188545,"dsir_math":-1235.75631536,"dsir_wiki":-1107.71685292,"rps_doc_num_sentences":10,"rps_doc_word_count":169.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.361328125,8.46875,6.4453125,-0.35595703125,-4.37890625,-6.87890625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":52.071005917159766,"fluency_en":[-3.326171875,3.044921875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":21.871921182266007,"dsir_books":-1183.47492709,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.9140625,-9.1640625,1.939453125,0.08197021484375,9.015625,1.4951171875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":37.75375645593918,"modernbert_reasoning":[6.58203125,10.84375,3.