{"id":"BkiUc-fxK0zjCxN_s_hL","content":"Het bleek dwergspinnetje (Mioxena blanda) is een spinnensoort in de taxonomische indeling van de hangmatspinnen (Linyphiidae).\n\nHet dier behoort tot het geslacht Mioxena. De wetenschappelijke naam van de soort werd voor het eerst geldig gepubliceerd in 1884 door Eugène Simon.\n\nHangmatspinnen","ad_en":[-3.1796875,3.728515625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.951219512195122,"fineweb_edu":[1.9162250757217407],"modernbert_readability":[-5.48828125,0.76953125,0.172607421875,1.9482421875,2.79296875,-0.9619140625],"qurater":[-2.287109375,-0.291015625,0.9892578125,-0.08062744140625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":4.098360655737705,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.30782738,"dsir_math":-447.13444232,"dsir_wiki":-433.9475947,"rps_doc_num_sentences":4,"rps_doc_word_count":41.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.900390625,0.0867919921875,3.06640625,3.291015625,0.89599609375,-2.783203125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":76.19047619047619,"fluency_en":[-1.2685546875,1.0576171875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":18.493150684931507,"dsir_books":-433.84116531,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-10.375,-10.5625,-0.833984375,-6.265625,10.8359375,7.2578125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":42.58043758043758,"modernbert_reasoning":[0.62255859375,9.3125,5.65625,-2.2109375,-4.33203125,-5.5234375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":80.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.9070294784580499,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdE44uzlhZ3WGL1FT","content":"Paratemelia meyi is een vlinder uit de familie zaksikkelmotten (Lypusidae). De wetenschappelijke naam van deze soort is voor het eerst geldig gepubliceerd in 2007 door Lvovsky.\n\nDe soort komt voor in tropisch Afrika.\n\nZaksikkelmotten\nDier uit het Afrotropisch gebied","ad_en":[-3.251953125,3.7734375],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.666666666666667,"fineweb_edu":[0.9708904027938843],"modernbert_readability":[-4.94921875,0.68505859375,-0.400390625,1.4306640625,2.70703125,0.06292724609375],"qurater":[-1.732421875,-0.0732421875,1.0693359375,-0.82421875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":0.0,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.33023094,"dsir_math":-423.31966587,"dsir_wiki":-407.47501927,"rps_doc_num_sentences":4,"rps_doc_word_count":39.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.609375,1.376953125,3.869140625,2.62109375,0.1685791015625,-3.634765625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":76.92307692307693,"fluency_en":[-0.9521484375,0.78466796875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":18.421052631578945,"dsir_books":-411.29826921,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.6171875,-10.34375,1.044921875,-1.255859375,11.3125,1.1376953125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":36.742091972355134,"modernbert_reasoning":[4.02734375,10.6796875,4.19140625,-4.4296875,-5.29296875,-5.82421875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":66.66666666666666,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.5813953488372093,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUa4_xK02iP15veMYw","content":"Ebony Ayes (28 de janeiro de 1962) é uma notória atriz pornográfica norte-americana. Alcançou o auge de sua carreira no final da década de 1980 e início da década de 1990, continuando seu trabalho até 1996. Juntamente com Jeannie Pepper e Heather Hunter, Ayes foi uma das três primeiras mulheres afro-americanas a participar de grandes filmes pornográficos.\n\nCarreira profissional \nAyes participou de filmes pornográficos entre 1985 e 1994 e chegou a atuar em mais de 110 filmes entre 1987 e 1989, seu período mais prolífico. A maioria de seus filmes são classificados como interracial ou fetichismo de mama.\n\nDepois de deixar os filmes pornográficos em 1994, Ayes trabalhou como dominatrix em Atlanta. Aposentou-se totalmente da indústria pornográfica no início de 2000.\n\nFilmografia \nDentre seus últimos filmes, estão:\nOffice Politics (1993)\nBlack Madam Sadista (1992)\nLesbian She Fights (1992)\nLesbian She Fights 2 (1992)\nBig Tit Orgy 3 (1991)\nBlack & Gold (1991)\nBackfield in Motion (1990)\nBig Tit Orgy 1 (1990)\nBusen Extra 2 (1990)\nKiss Thy Mistress' Feet (1990)\nLesbian Fantasies (1990)\nRise of the Roman Empress 2 (1990)\n\nLigações externas\nPágina oficial\n\nAtrizes pornográficas dos Estados Unidos\nAyes, Ebony","ad_en":[-0.6533203125,0.40478515625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.247368421052632,"fineweb_edu":[0.796639084815979],"modernbert_readability":[-7.95703125,-3.50390625,-1.6650390625,1.0068359375,6.62109375,4.5234375],"qurater":[-2.6875,-2.09765625,-0.430908203125,-4.6640625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":6.018054162487462,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.60975075,"dsir_math":-1595.45721289,"dsir_wiki":-1574.52697579,"rps_doc_num_sentences":8,"rps_doc_word_count":190.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.8828125,8.8515625,5.9140625,-0.101318359375,-4.20703125,-6.7734375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":63.67924528301887,"fluency_en":[1.0537109375,-1.056640625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":29.958847736625515,"dsir_books":