{"id":"BkiUa2TxK03BfHDu2Yol","content":"Life Is Sweet è un singolo del supergruppo italiano Fabi Silvestri Gazzè, pubblicato il 25 aprile 2014 come primo estratto dal primo album in studio Il padrone della festa.\n\nSi tratta della prima pubblicazione della formazione, composta dai cantautori e musicisti Niccolò Fabi, Daniele Silvestri e Max Gazzè.\n\nVideo musicale \nIl videoclip è stato pubblicato su YouTube il 20 maggio 2014 ed è diretto e montato da Nicola Berti. Il video è stato girato in Sud Sudan.\n\nTracce\n\nNote\n\nCollegamenti esterni","ad_en":[-1.6240234375,1.8173828125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.111111111111111,"fineweb_edu":[0.43843957781791687],"modernbert_readability":[-7.23046875,0.148681640625,0.92822265625,2.400390625,3.109375,-1.333984375],"qurater":[-2.12890625,-4.1796875,-3.138671875,-5.234375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":3.3816425120772946,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.99123076,"dsir_math":-745.07538857,"dsir_wiki":-735.20601086,"rps_doc_num_sentences":5,"rps_doc_word_count":81.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.498046875,7.484375,5.640625,-0.07537841796875,-3.892578125,-6.3125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":74.07407407407408,"fluency_en":[0.53955078125,-0.11572265625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":22.39999999999999,"dsir_books":-731.65902191,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.0,-7.88671875,5.17578125,3.2265625,7.62109375,-5.5390625],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":47.368673568457005,"modernbert_reasoning":[7.5703125,11.359375,1.609375,-5.265625,-7.140625,-6.4375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":66.66666666666666,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.1149884079447405,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUaf7xK0iCl2n19Fqf","content":"János Garay, född 10 oktober 1812 i Szekszárd, död 5 november 1853 i Pest, var en ungersk skald. \n\nGaray gjorde sig särskilt känd som författare av en mängd patriotiska ballader (bland andra Báthori Erzsébet och Kont) samt längre episka dikter (bland andra Szent László) med ämnen ur sitt lands historia, men uppträdde också som lyrisk och dramatisk författare. En av hans mest kända dikter är den humoristiska Az obsitos (Den uttjänte soldaten) som ligger till grund för Zoltán Kodálys opera Háry János. Hans samlade arbeten utgavs 1886 ff. i fem band av József Ferenczy.\n\nKällor\n\nUngerska författare\nUngerskspråkiga författare\nPersoner i Ungern under 1800-talet\nPersoner från Szekszárd\nFödda 1812\nAvlidna 1853\nMän\nUgglan\n\nit:János Garay\nno:János Garay","ad_en":[-3.21484375,3.654296875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.555555555555555,"fineweb_edu":[1.2328667640686035],"modernbert_readability":[-7.328125,-2.392578125,-0.91943359375,0.9521484375,4.94140625,1.8779296875],"qurater":[1.1630859375,1.1591796875,0.459716796875,-0.06475830078125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":3.076923076923077,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.40514589,"dsir_math":-1067.1143935,"dsir_wiki":-1061.73139696,"rps_doc_num_sentences":6,"rps_doc_word_count":117.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.322265625,6.12109375,4.69140625,1.1220703125,-2.49609375,-5.6953125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":70.86092715231787,"fluency_en":[-0.69189453125,0.63671875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":26.82602921646746,"dsir_books":-1059.27461542,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.578125,-7.16015625,4.421875,1.7861328125,6.4453125,-3.544921875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":32.04500709502325,"modernbert_reasoning":[0.97314453125,9.8203125,5.58203125,-2.669921875,-4.87109375,-6.1640625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":35.294117647058826,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":7.238689340962069,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","