{"id":"BkiUa5c5i7PA9OgJCwEE","content":"IC 4542B — галактика типу S? (спіральна галактика) у сузір'ї Волопас.\n\nЦей об'єкт міститься в оригінальній редакції індексного каталогу.\n\nПосилання \n\n IC 4542B  в оригінальному новому загальному каталозі \n IC 4542B в оригінальному новому загальному каталозі \n Перевірена інформація про IC 4542B\n IC 4542B в базі SIMBAD\n IC 4542B в базі Vizier\n IC 4542B в базі NASA Extragalactic  Database\n Бази даних про об'єкти NGC/IC\n\nIC 4542B\nIC 4542B\nIC 4542B","ad_en":[-1.55859375,1.6484375],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.373134328358209,"fineweb_edu":[0.9448369741439819],"modernbert_readability":[-6.27734375,1.67578125,1.7724609375,1.9013671875,2.548828125,-2.384765625],"qurater":[-4.109375,-0.314208984375,-0.84521484375,-3.72265625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":19.444444444444446,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.18356036,"dsir_math":-792.66333314,"dsir_wiki":-780.15060313,"rps_doc_num_sentences":4,"rps_doc_word_count":67.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-4.4609375,-0.78857421875,1.6884765625,2.515625,1.55078125,-1.775390625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":53.03030303030303,"fluency_en":[1.2412109375,-1.0302734375],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":83.668903803132,"dsir_books":-790.26611728,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-6.015625,-0.1827392578125,8.890625,5.5546875,1.361328125,-12.1875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":38.26182834253577,"modernbert_reasoning":[-0.5322265625,7.7265625,5.6015625,-1.3095703125,-4.05078125,-5.12109375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":11,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":35.294117647058826,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":17.636214499310363,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdX44uBhiwecdfYjp","content":"Longitarsus pratensis är en skalbaggsart som först beskrevs av Georg Wolfgang Franz Panzer 1794.  Longitarsus pratensis ingår i släktet Longitarsus och familjen bladbaggar. Arten är reproducerande i Sverige. Inga underarter finns listade i Catalogue of Life.\n\nBildgalleri\n\nKällor\n\nExterna länkar \n\nBladbaggar\npratensis","ad_en":[-3.646484375,4.21875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.523809523809524,"fineweb_edu":[0.8292500376701355],"modernbert_readability":[-6.46875,0.85009765625,0.67919921875,2.18359375,3.3359375,-1.3701171875],"qurater":[-3.408203125,-0.26220703125,1.32421875,-1.419921875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":14.5985401459854,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.43623868,"dsir_math":-457.2739882,"dsir_wiki":-453.60147593,"rps_doc_num_sentences":5,"rps_doc_word_count":42.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-4.37890625,1.56640625,3.966796875,2.60546875,0.279052734375,-3.490234375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":77.55102040816327,"fluency_en":[-1.34375,1.2236328125],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":19.49685534591194,"dsir_books":-459.39950698,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-6.95703125,-3.4921875,7.1328125,5.83203125,4.5703125,-9.1640625],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":44.707540521494,"modernbert_reasoning":[2.54296875,10.625,4.55078125,-3.634765625,-5.34765625,-5.84765625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":50.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.2583979328165375,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUcgg5qhLAB45oJHgq","content":"Liste von Universitäten und Colleges im US-Bundesstaat Washington:\n\nStaatliche Hochschulen \n Central Washington University\n Eastern Washington University\n The Evergreen State College\n University of Washington\n Washington State University\n Western Washington University\n\nPrivate Hochschulen \n Antioch University Seattle\n Argosy University/Seattle\n Art Institute of Seattle\n Bastyr University\n City University\n Cornish College of the Arts\n DeVry University\n DigiPen Institute of Technology\n Gonzaga University\n Henry Cogswell College\n Heritage College\n Northwest University\n Pacific Lutheran University\n St. Martin's University\n School of Visual Concepts\n Seattle Bible College\n Seattle Pacific University\n Seattle University\n Trinity Lutheran College\n University of Puget Sound\n Walla Walla College\n Whitman College\n Whitworth College\n\n!\nWashington\nUniversitaten Washington","ad_en":[-2.076171875,2.333984375],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":7.414141414141414,"fineweb_edu":[0.6368842720985413],"modernbert_readability":[-6.3125,1.1806640625,1.029296875,1.990234375,1.275390625,-1.8173828125],"qurater":[-2.595703125,-0.057037353515625,1.0625,1.8671875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":8.174386920980927,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.49134429,"dsir_math":-962.97903663,"dsir_wiki":-886.20177646,"rps_doc_num_sentences":3,"rps_doc_word_count":99.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-4.3828125,7.828125,4.765625,-0.1390380859375,-2.7890625,-6.2734375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":54.0,"fluency_en":[-0.18408203125,0.64990234375],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":16.055045871559642,"dsir_books":-941.87747515,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.0234375,1.69921875,10.359375,0.324462890625,1.01171875,-9.078125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":18.073460376515254,"modernbert_reasoning":[9.203125,8.3515625,-0.1881103515625,-5.36328125,-5.671875,-5.984375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":5,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":10.5263