{"id":"BkiUfFI5qhDCNj5tidCR","content":"James Newton Howard, född 9 juni 1951 i Los Angeles i Kalifornien, är en amerikansk filmkompositör. Howard har nominerats till nio Oscar.\n\nFilmmusik (i urval)\n\nReferenser\n\nNoter\n\nExterna länkar \n\nAmerikanska filmmusikkompositörer\nFödda 1951\nLevande personer\nMän\nMusiker från Los Angeles\nAlumner från University of Southern California","ad_en":[-3.271484375,3.634765625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.195652173913044,"fineweb_edu":[0.5345181226730347],"modernbert_readability":[-5.74609375,0.578125,0.9326171875,2.23046875,2.9140625,-1.9755859375],"qurater":[-1.3505859375,-1.775390625,-0.650390625,-2.40234375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":7.017543859649122,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.6063086,"dsir_math":-477.42789919,"dsir_wiki":-465.55091202,"rps_doc_num_sentences":3,"rps_doc_word_count":46.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.517578125,8.75,5.234375,-0.8662109375,-3.62109375,-6.203125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":80.0,"fluency_en":[-0.40576171875,0.74072265625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":22.52252252252252,"dsir_books":-465.82668763,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-5.3671875,2.06640625,11.9140625,4.92578125,-0.064697265625,-14.0078125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":38.84865807233419,"modernbert_reasoning":[6.6953125,10.1015625,1.603515625,-5.0546875,-6.23828125,-6.0],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":37.5,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":3.6400097228974233,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUc3w5qX_Bk6r0rg81","content":"Konkurencja slalomu giganta równoległego mężczyzn w snowboardzie na Zimowej Uniwersjadzie 2013 została rozegrana 19 grudnia. Złotym medalistą został reprezentant Austrii Sebastian Kislinger. \n\nW konkurencji tej startowało czterech reprezentantów Polski. Tomasz Kowalczyk został sklasyfikowany na 8. miejscu, Jędrzej Derda na 18., Oskar Bom na 24., a Andrzej Gąsienica-Daniel na 31.\n\nWyniki\n\nKwalifikacje\n\n1/8 finału\n\nĆwierćfinał\n\nPółfinał\n\nFinał\n\nBibliografia \n \n \n\nSnowboard na Zimowej Uniwersjadzie 2013","ad_en":[-2.751953125,3.2265625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.887096774193548,"fineweb_edu":[0.7250673174858093],"modernbert_readability":[-5.79296875,0.7509765625,1.1474609375,1.4169921875,2.287109375,-1.451171875],"qurater":[-3.2734375,-1.9580078125,0.63037109375,-1.9716796875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":4.215456674473068,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.81958079,"dsir_math":-644.37154709,"dsir_wiki":-646.85012545,"rps_doc_num_sentences":8,"rps_doc_word_count":62.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.427734375,6.26953125,4.8203125,0.261962890625,-2.47265625,-4.9609375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":81.69014084507043,"fluency_en":[-0.78759765625,0.806640625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":25.34653465346534,"dsir_books":-657.79699443,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.6640625,-7.41796875,6.58203125,5.640625,5.87890625,-7.78125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":47.21388141768002,"modernbert_reasoning":[3.234375,10.2265625,4.24609375,-3.90625,-5.625,-5.76953125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":10,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":61.904761904761905,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":3.9449786324786316,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdtk4eIXh8AOmA8Iv","content":"Steven Jay Blum is een Amerikaanse stemacteur in animes en computerspellen. Hij staat bekend om zijn zeer diepe stem.\n\nCarrière \nBlum heeft stemmen ingesproken voor honderden personages. Enkele hiervan zijn Spike Spiegel uit Cowboy Bebop, Zeb Orrelios in Star Wars Rebels, Mugen in Samurai Champloo, Roger Smith van The Big O en Wolverine in verschillende computerspellen en animatieseries.\n\nHij sprak ook de stem in van Jack Cayman van het computerspel MadWorld, Tank Dempsey in Call of Duty: World at War, Call of Duty: Black Ops en Call of Duty: Black Ops II, Call of Duty: Black Ops III, Call of Duty: Black Ops 4 en professor Galvez in Metal Gear Solid: Peace Walker.\n\nOp 5 juni 2012 haalde hij het Guinness-wereldrecord als productiefste stemacteur voor computerspellen, met 261 ingesproken stemmen op 10 mei van dat jaar.\n\nExterne links \n Website van Steve Blum\n \n Steve Blum op Behind The Voice Actors\n\nAmerikaans stemacteur","ad_en":[-1.3310546875,1.4248046875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":4.973509933774834,"fineweb_edu":[0.751275360584259],"modernbert_readability":[-7.82421875,-2.142578125,-1.0078125,1.3896484375,5.2109375,2.32421875],"qurater":[-2.123046875,-1.7392578125,1.083984375,-2.8359375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":3.9946737683089215,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.38968677,"dsir_math":-1261.02491349,"dsir_wiki":-1248.67175224,"rps_doc_num_sentences":7,"rps_doc_word_count":151.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.38671875,5.953125,5.1328125,1.0625,-2.470703125,-5.8515625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":66.44736842105263,"fluency_en":[-0.6015625,0.75244140625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":20.815450643776828,"dsir_books":-1256.57368681,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-7.6953125,-5.96875,6.296875,6.10546875,6.58203125,-9.3828125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":38.577019623575296,"modernbert_reasoning":[0.1759033203125,10.1015625,6.25,-2.638671875,-5.109375,-6.1171875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":6,"rps_lines_ending_