{"id":"BkiUbYM5qsFAfsI7Xe_1","content":"Frozen in Time je šesti studijski album američkog death metal-sastava Obituary objavljen 18. srpnja 2005. godine. Prvi je album sastava od ponovnog okupljanja 2003. godine. Posljednji je album sastava s gitaristom Allenom Westom. Također prvi je album sastava od albuma World Demise objavljen u 1994. godine i posljednji koji je producirao Scott Burns.\n\nPopis pjesama\n\nOsoblje \n\nObituary\n\n John Tardy - vokali\n Allen West - glavna gitara\n Trevor Peres - ritam gitara, dizajn\n Frank Watkins - bas-gitara\n Donald Tardy - bubnjevi\n\nOstalo osoblje\n\n Aaron Callier - inženjer zvuka\n Tom Morris - mastering\n Daragh McDonagh - slike (sastava)\n Scott Burns - produkcija\n Mark Prator - produkcjia, inženjer zvuka, miksanje\n Andreas Marschall - omot\n\nIzvori \n\nAlbumi sastava Obituary\nAlbumi iz 2005.","ad_en":[-2.984375,3.69921875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.869158878504673,"fineweb_edu":[0.4824537932872772],"modernbert_readability":[-7.46484375,0.2685546875,1.2412109375,2.44921875,3.650390625,-1.291015625],"qurater":[-2.755859375,-1.845703125,-1.3037109375,-3.916015625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":3.343949044585987,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.24055727,"dsir_math":-1074.40683109,"dsir_wiki":-1036.75130135,"rps_doc_num_sentences":9,"rps_doc_word_count":107.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.26953125,5.84765625,4.5859375,0.2230224609375,-2.251953125,-5.05078125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":72.97297297297297,"fluency_en":[-0.056732177734375,-0.111572265625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":23.8276299112801,"dsir_books":-1063.23058995,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-7.828125,-5.7890625,7.41796875,6.21875,5.25,-9.3671875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":35.38845761817066,"modernbert_reasoning":[3.474609375,9.5546875,3.53515625,-3.416015625,-5.57421875,-5.9453125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":6,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":37.03703703703704,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.7173368203116486,"sub_path