{"id":"BkiUey7xaKgQTovFRuQr","content":"Moldavië nam deel aan de Olympische Zomerspelen 2012 in Londen, Verenigd Koninkrijk.\n\nDe twee bronzen medailles die in het gewichtheffen door Anatoli Ciricu (middenzwaargewicht) en Cristina Iovu (vedergewicht) werden behaald werden in een later stadium afgenomen.\n\nDeelnemers en resultaten \n(m) = mannen, (v) = vrouwen\n\nAtletiek\n\nBoksen\n\nBoogschieten\n\nGewichtheffen \n\n \n * De twee bronzen medailles die werden behaald werden in een later stadium afgenomen.\n\nJudo\n\nSchietsport\n\nWielersport\n\nWorstelen\n\nZwemmen \n\nLand op de Olympische Zomerspelen 2012\n2012","ad_en":[-2.31640625,3.16015625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.194444444444445,"fineweb_edu":[0.9347683191299438],"modernbert_readability":[-6.24609375,1.6689453125,1.42578125,2.1796875,2.548828125,-2.408203125],"qurater":[-2.998046875,-1.314453125,1.46484375,-1.0380859375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":5.381165919282512,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.7495384,"dsir_math":-743.6476576,"dsir_wiki":-764.95749935,"rps_doc_num_sentences":4,"rps_doc_word_count":72.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.09765625,6.77734375,5.078125,0.059844970703125,-2.7734375,-5.08203125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":66.66666666666666,"fluency_en":[0.666015625,-0.45263671875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":22.021660649819495,"dsir_books":-766.38594386,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.890625,-8.0234375,4.48828125,2.783203125,8.359375,-5.56640625],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":47.81536766251619,"modernbert_reasoning":[3.96875,10.6875,4.359375,-3.923828125,-6.0234375,-6.15625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":10,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":56.666666666666664,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":7.209099556119214,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
