{"id":"BkiUdt85qsFAfn88t2nR","content":"El río Logone (o Logon) es el principal afluente del río Chari. Discurre entre zonas pantanosas y humedales en su mayor parte. Frontera natural entre Chad y Camerún durante parte de su curso.\n\nLogone\nLogone\nLogone\nYamena\nFrontera Camerún-Chad\nLogone","ad_en":[-1.548828125,1.4013671875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.175,"fineweb_edu":[1.1229490041732788],"modernbert_readability":[-5.046875,1.83203125,0.284423828125,2.580078125,2.904296875,-0.83203125],"qurater":[-3.0703125,-0.76171875,0.0931396484375,-2.787109375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":11.594202898550725,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.2450982,"dsir_math":-478.90989343,"dsir_wiki":-476.81793488,"rps_doc_num_sentences":4,"rps_doc_word_count":40.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-2.72265625,6.99609375,5.14453125,0.063720703125,-2.44140625,-5.734375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":68.18181818181817,"fluency_en":[-0.734375,0.5810546875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":20.08032128514057,"dsir_books":-470.87368704,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-7.9765625,-2.84765625,9.8828125,7.02734375,5.03515625,-12.6484375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":25.22594116180504,"modernbert_reasoning":[5.73828125,10.6171875,3.033203125,-4.28125,-5.1484375,-5.90234375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":25.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.0,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
