{"id":"BkiUa3PxK6Ot9Pm3tNTQ","content":"Bivès är en kommun i departementet Gers i regionen Occitanien i sydvästra Frankrike. Kommunen ligger i kantonen Saint-Clar som tillhör arrondissementet Condom. År  hade Bivès  invånare.\n\nBefolkningsutveckling \nAntalet invånare i kommunen Bivès\n\nReferens:INSEE\n\nSe även \n Lista över kommuner i departementet Gers\n\nKällor\n\nExterna länkar \n\nKommuner i Gers","ad_en":[-2.41015625,2.765625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.446808510638298,"fineweb_edu":[0.8853572607040405],"modernbert_readability":[-6.24609375,0.96533203125,0.7353515625,2.0546875,2.97265625,-2.39453125],"qurater":[-3.779296875,-2.546875,-1.6474609375,-2.89453125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":9.24092409240924,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.30210032,"dsir_math":-530.18122874,"dsir_wiki":-536.22598243,"rps_doc_num_sentences":4,"rps_doc_word_count":47.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-2.802734375,6.78125,5.24609375,0.158447265625,-2.48828125,-5.98828125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":65.0,"fluency_en":[-0.82763671875,0.65625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":21.52974504249292,"dsir_books":-536.98093273,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-5.81640625,-3.91015625,6.3515625,6.19140625,3.830078125,-10.6796875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":47.52755495438423,"modernbert_reasoning":[3.142578125,10.6875,4.6953125,-3.46875,-5.25390625,-5.9375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":11,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":46.666666666666664,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.0,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
