{"id":"BkiUfo3xK7IDA31U2AAQ","content":"\n\nАкбай — село, Аральський район, Кизилординська область\n Акбай — село, Сайрамський район, Туркестанська область","ad_en":[-1.5888671875,1.685546875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":7.071428571428571,"fineweb_edu":[0.38322749733924866],"modernbert_readability":[-4.52734375,3.955078125,0.302734375,1.4423828125,0.15673828125,-2.853515625],"qurater":[-4.21484375,-2.197265625,-1.58984375,-3.966796875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":14.14141414141414,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":2.1439522,"dsir_math":-202.68642501,"dsir_wiki":-201.71169531,"rps_doc_num_sentences":1,"rps_doc_word_count":14.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.236328125,6.55078125,3.57421875,-0.5625,-2.041015625,-5.0],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":66.66666666666666,"fluency_en":[0.638671875,-0.49267578125],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":100.0,"dsir_books":-198.24657231,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.296875,-0.95068359375,9.296875,4.0390625,3.353515625,-11.90625],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":52.75252525252525,"modernbert_reasoning":[11.8359375,8.6015625,-1.7578125,-6.12890625,-5.9609375,-6.0546875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":22,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":50.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.0,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUawrxK6mkyCKCyg9K","content":"ar-Raschid Billah (; † 1138 in Isfahan; auch al-Raschid) war der dreißigste Kalif der Abbasiden (1135–1136).\n\nAbu Dscha'far al-Mansur ibn al-Fadl al-Mustarschid ar-Raschid bi-'llah trat 1135 die Nachfolge seines Vaters al-Mustarshid (1118–1135) in Bagdad an. Dieser Thronfolge stimmte allerdings Seldschukensultan Mas'ud ibn Muhammad in Persien nicht zu. Obwohl sich ar-Rashid mit den Beduinen im Irak verbündet hatte, konnte er 1136 von den Seldschuken geschlagen und abgesetzt werden. Als neuer Kalif wurde al-Muqtafi inthronisiert (1136–1160). Ar-Rashid versuchte in der Folgezeit vergeblich den Thron zurückzuerobern, wurde aber 1138 von einem Schiiten auf der Pol-e Scharestan in Isfahan ermordet.\n\nKalif (Abbasiden)\nGeboren im 11. oder 12. Jahrhundert\nGestorben 1138\nMann","ad_en":[-3.24609375,3.92578125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.981132075471698,"fineweb_edu":[1.6765694618225098],"modernbert_readability":[-7.11328125,-1.0400390625,-0.0977783203125,1.01953125,4.27734375,1.1689453125],"qurater":[-1.28515625,3.298828125,0.65087890625,-1.8818359375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":4.73186119873817,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.32422658,"dsir_math":-1155.43255856,"dsir_wiki":-1143.47963347,"rps_doc_num_sentences":9,"rps_doc_word_count":106.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-4.08203125,1.2314453125,2.484375,2.36328125,0.150146484375,-3.2265625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":76.36363636363637,"fluency_en":[-0.2099609375,0.239013671875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":25.740025740025743,"dsir_books":-1165.11978964,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.2578125,-7.36328125,1.5400390625,-4.1953125,8.6796875,5.42578125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":32.5728512125571,"modernbert_reasoning":[-1.58203125,6.7734375,5.12890625,-1.1015625,-3.099609375,-4.8359375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":50.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":9.641636558929793,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_so