{"id":"BkiUdik4eIXgu5sT-Nk7","content":"Турыгин — фамилия; имеет женскую форму Турыгина.\n\nИзвестные носители \n Турыгин, Валерьян Михайлович (1914—2000) — советский полковник, Герой Советского Союза.\n Турыгин, Иван Афанасьевич (1904—1966) — советский оптик, профессор. См. также","ad_en":[-2.96484375,3.7109375],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.758620689655173,"fineweb_edu":[0.5233588218688965],"modernbert_readability":[-6.453125,0.2203369140625,0.331787109375,1.025390625,2.603515625,-0.6181640625],"qurater":[-4.04296875,-1.9736328125,-1.6220703125,-3.873046875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":11.224489795918368,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.09219348,"dsir_math":-419.3562244,"dsir_wiki":-413.43747957,"rps_doc_num_sentences":5,"rps_doc_word_count":29.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.6484375,5.5859375,3.171875,-0.1212158203125,-2.060546875,-4.16796875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":89.65517241379311,"fluency_en":[0.779296875,-0.64306640625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":100.0,"dsir_books":-405.10205768,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.4921875,-8.1171875,6.58203125,6.03125,6.1953125,-9.59375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":24.27524230155809,"modernbert_reasoning":[6.8046875,9.6796875,1.9365234375,-5.41015625,-6.25,-6.43359375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":60.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":5.1307189542483655,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUa8TxK5YsWPOod-Lb","content":"Alex Murray, né le  à Georgetown, est un footballeur international guyanien jouant poste de gardien de but à Morvant Caledonia United.\n\nBiographie\n\nEn club \n\nLayne joue dans différents clubs guyaniens comme Alpha United, le Georgetown FC ou encore le Santos FC. En 2019, il rejoint le Morvant Caledonia United à Trinité-et-Tobago.\n\nEn sélection \n\nLe , il fait ses débuts avec le Guyana lors d'un match amical contre le Suriname (victoire 2-0).\n\nEn , il est retenu par le sélectionneur Michael Johnson afin de participer à la Gold Cup organisée aux États-Unis, en Jamaïque et au Costa Rica. Lors de cette Gold Cup, il officiera comme remplaçant et ne jouera aucun match.\n\nPalmarès \n  Alpha United\n Championnat du Guyana \n Champion : 2012, 2013 et 2014\n Guyana Mayors Cup \n Vainqueur : 2013\n\nRéférences\n\nLiens externes \n \n\nFootballeur international guyanien\nGardien de but au football\nJoueur du Caledonia AIA\nNaissance en novembre 1992\nNaissance à Georgetown (Guyana)","ad_en":[-2.029296875,2.427734375],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.277027027027027,"fineweb_edu":[0.5942436456680298],"modernbert_readability":[-7.51171875,-1.5546875,-0.1917724609375,1.90625,5.07421875,0.91552734375],"qurater":[-2.818359375,-1.736328125,-0.39111328125,-2.482421875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":3.0729833546734953,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.34270989,"dsir_math":-1350.41493426,"dsir_wiki":-1314.98812982,"rps_doc_num_sentences":7,"rps_doc_word_count":148.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.462890625,7.10546875,5.55859375,0.049713134765625,-3.45703125,-5.71875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":63.74999999999999,"fluency_en":[0.1064453125,0.31201171875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":25.492227979274602,"dsir_books":-1286.554025,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.46875,-9.2578125,4.03515625,1.3720703125,9.2734375,-1.279296875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":37.74625030459285,"modernbert_reasoning":[4.40625,10.1640625,3.740234375,-4.3984375,-6.44