{"id":"BkiUd3I4dbjiVFhKgOJM","content":"Dzhungarocosa is a genus of Kazakh wolf spiders first described by A. A. Fomichev & Yuri M. Marusik in 2017.  it contains only three species.\n\nReferences\n\nExternal links\n\nAraneomorphae genera\nLycosidae","ad_en":[-3.3515625,3.84765625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.366666666666666,"fineweb_edu":[1.2996909618377686],"modernbert_readability":[-5.8984375,-0.8974609375,-1.5546875,1.6748046875,2.9140625,1.625],"qurater":[-3.763671875,-0.50732421875,3.642578125,-0.76513671875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":0.0,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.29133615,"dsir_math":-309.11868829,"dsir_wiki":-304.21532531,"rps_doc_num_sentences":6,"rps_doc_word_count":30.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.541015625,2.3671875,4.22265625,2.060546875,-0.385009765625,-3.806640625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":93.33333333333333,"fluency_en":[-2.109375,1.7294921875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":21.890547263681597,"dsir_books":-313.58180521,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.84375,-8.046875,7.3671875,7.7734375,6.88671875,-10.8671875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":42.365965889902064,"modernbert_reasoning":[6.30859375,11.1875,2.33203125,-4.90625,-6.1171875,-5.91796875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":50.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.6015037593984962,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUennxK6nrxpQc2lnA","content":"Tricolia tenuis:é uma espécie de molusco(animais invertebrados,terrestres ou marinhos de agua doçe ou salgada) pertencente à família Phasianellidae.(existem exatamentes 20 espécies dessa familia de moluscos)\n\nA autoridade científica da espécie é Michaud, tendo sido descrita no ano de 1829.\n\nTrata-se de uma espécie presente no território português, incluindo a zona económica exclusiva.\n\nReferências \n Tricolia tenuis - World Register of Marine Species (consultado em 29 de dezembro de 2013).\n\nLigações externas \n\n Tricolia tenuis - Biodiversity Heritage Library - Bibliografia\n Tricolia tenuis - NCBI Taxonomy Database\n Tricolia tenuis - Global Biodiversity Information Facility\n Tricolia tenuis - Encyclopedia of Life\n\nMoluscos de Portugal\ntenuis\nAnimais descritos em 1829","ad_en":[-3.484375,4.1875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.595959595959596,"fineweb_edu":[2.1552560329437256],"modernbert_readability":[-8.0234375,-2.568359375,-1.271484375,0.630859375,5.46484375,3.4921875],"qurater":[-2.96875,-0.349609375,1.1103515625,-0.84716796875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":10.719754977029096,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.05058316,"dsir_math":-998.92368233,"dsir_wiki":-980.62839471,"rps_doc_num_sentences":5,"rps_doc_word_count":99.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-5.4296875,-0.486328125,2.4296875,3.8515625,1.49609375,-2.30078125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":70.53571428571429,"fluency_en":[-0.7431640625,0.9521484375],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":21.935483870967744,"dsir_books":-988.48327502,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.2109375,-7.0078125,8.5625,7.87109375,6.41015625,-11.96875],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":35.73936357744208,"modernbert_reasoning":[-0.78955078125,9.4609375,5.83203125,-1.7197265625,-4.05078125,-5.1015625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":47.368421052631575,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":2.223672776639026,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_sour