{"id":"BkiUbiA5qdmB66aQ4u_r","content":"Cottonwood é uma Região censo-designada localizada no estado americano de Colorado, no Condado de Douglas.\n\nDemografia \nSegundo o censo americano de 2000, a sua população era de 931 habitantes.\n\nGeografia \nDe acordo com o United States Census Bureau tem uma área de\n2,3 km², dos quais 2,3 km² cobertos por terra e 0,0 km² cobertos por água.\n\nLocalidades na vizinhança \nO diagrama seguinte representa as localidades num raio de 8 km ao redor de Cottonwood.\n\nLigações externas \n \n\nCidades do Colorado","ad_en":[-3.447265625,4.11328125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.075,"fineweb_edu":[2.008819818496704],"modernbert_readability":[-6.625,-1.12890625,0.00209808349609375,2.05078125,4.0625,0.1737060546875],"qurater":[-3.533203125,-3.21484375,-0.52392578125,-1.978515625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":5.41871921182266,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.93572844,"dsir_math":-762.31457236,"dsir_wiki":-760.66629207,"rps_doc_num_sentences":5,"rps_doc_word_count":80.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.052734375,8.0625,6.3671875,0.5302734375,-3.69921875,-7.17578125],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":68.18181818181817,"fluency_en":[-1.0625,0.88623046875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":25.502008032128515,"dsir_books":-752.66126399,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.3125,-8.921875,6.30859375,4.37109375,9.4921875,-6.4375],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":34.7441210059001,"modernbert_reasoning":[4.51171875,10.7421875,3.888671875,-4.1484375,-5.53125,-6.05078125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":6,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":62.5,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.9336940255554276,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUes3xK1UJ-rWoKpta","content":"The Sherrard Falls is a cascade waterfall on an unnamed stream that is located in the New England region of New South Wales, Australia.\n\nLocation and features\nThe waterfall is situated adjacent to the Waterfall Way between the town of  and the locality of , in the Dorrigo National Park. It is around  from the town of Dorrigo and around  from the Newell Falls. The bridge across Sherrard Falls is one lane. Vehicular and pedestrian access and viewing of the Sherrard Falls is difficult due to no car parking on the narrow Waterfall Way. The Waterfall Way is subject to closure at Sherrard Falls and Newell Falls in times of high rain, due to flooding over the road.\n\nSee also\n\nList of waterfalls of Australia\n\nReferences\n\n \n \n\nWaterfalls of New South Wales\nNew England (New South Wales)\nCascade waterfalls\nWaterfalls of the Waterfall Way\nBellingen Shire","ad_en":[-3.310546875,4.06640625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":4.763888888888889,"fineweb_edu":[1.9089001417160034],"modernbert_readability":[-8.265625,-2.880859375,-2.1328125,0.5966796875,5.63671875,3.40234375],"qurater":[-0.74072265625,-2.087890625,2.646484375,1.81640625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":7.580174927113703,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.83441053,"dsir_math":-1032.68888256,"dsir_wiki":-960.57814854,"rps_doc_num_sentences":7,"rps_doc_word_count":144.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.98046875,9.46875,6.81640625,0.09771728515625,-4.91015625,-8.0],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":47.22222222222222,"fluency_en":[-2.658203125,2.609375],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":19.67213114754098,"dsir_books":-1005.86584282,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-9.953125,-6.76953125,3.927734375,0.34130859375,6.5859375,-2.142578125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":37.100628515977554,"modernbert_reasoning":[3.84375,10.8359375,3.625,-4.32421875,-5.9609375,-7.046875],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":6,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":52.63157894736842,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fr