{"id":"BkiUfR_xaKgQW0DXroyl","content":"Odontaster crassus is een zeester uit de familie Odontasteridae.\n\nDe wetenschappelijke naam van de soort werd in 1905 gepubliceerd door Walter Kenrick Fisher.\n\nValvatida","ad_en":[-3.326171875,4.00390625],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":5.916666666666667,"fineweb_edu":[1.338984727859497],"modernbert_readability":[-4.44140625,3.94921875,1.5595703125,1.775390625,0.68798828125,-3.171875],"qurater":[-2.423828125,-0.152587890625,0.7802734375,-0.71337890625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":0.0,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":3.04072729,"dsir_math":-265.87923879,"dsir_wiki":-252.04804608,"rps_doc_num_sentences":3,"rps_doc_word_count":24.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-3.3203125,2.94140625,4.20703125,1.96484375,-0.39453125,-3.873046875],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":91.66666666666666,"fluency_en":[-0.09576416015625,0.20458984375],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":18.34319526627219,"dsir_books":-252.57016134,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.3203125,-8.859375,5.98828125,3.4375,10.1796875,-9.1328125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":43.71678743961353,"modernbert_reasoning":[7.52734375,10.1171875,1.296875,-5.17578125,-5.421875,-5.6640625],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":80.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.4652014652014653,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUdrg4uBhhxIH739Q1","content":"Don kan som auktorsförkortning betyda:\n\n David Don\n George Don sr\n George Don jr\n\nRobotskapade auktorsförkortningar","ad_en":[-1.4267578125,1.8154296875],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.466666666666667,"fineweb_edu":[-0.07967891544103622],"modernbert_readability":[-3.40234375,2.953125,0.6572265625,1.4365234375,0.431884765625,-1.82421875],"qurater":[-2.66015625,-1.4619140625,-1.580078125,-2.751953125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":18.556701030927837,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":2.24595208,"dsir_math":-193.02777341,"dsir_wiki":-189.18717854,"rps_doc_num_sentences":1,"rps_doc_word_count":15.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-2.537109375,6.23828125,4.140625,-0.58984375,-1.8916015625,-4.65234375],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":70.58823529411765,"fluency_en":[1.0703125,-0.70556640625],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":19.130434782608702,"dsir_books":-189.0414993,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-5.203125,3.794921875,10.6015625,2.806640625,1.0439453125,-13.890625],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":36.31904436415714,"modernbert_reasoning":[8.015625,9.953125,0.8642578125,-5.3984375,-5.64453125,-5.17578125],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":28.57142857142857,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":0.0,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_source_path":"wikipedia/part-6777d8857c6e-000341.jsonl"}
{"id":"BkiUbTbxK0-nUh8iH-tI","content":"Гавайит (; не путать с вулканической горной породой гавайит) — минерал магматического происхождения, названный по месту находки в лавовых потоках острова Гавайи. Бледно-зелёная, бедная железом разновидность оливина.\n\nОписание \nВ геммологии гавайит ( — термин для перидота, собранного на Гавайях, который является оливиновым минералом ювелирного качества.\n\nВстречается размером до 1,5 см. Хрупкий, цельные кристаллы редки.\n\nСвойства схожи с другими оливинами (хризолит).\n\nПримечания\n\nЛитература \n Jackson J. A. Hawaiite // Glossary of Geology. American Geological Institute, 1997.\n\nСсылки \n На Большом острове Гавайев извергающийся вулкан Килауэа начал выбрасывать драгоценные камни на runews24, 2018.\n О гавайите — Хризолит — вечерний изумруд.\n\nМинералы\nГавайи","ad_en":[-2.818359375,3.220703125],"rps_doc_mean_word_length":6.726315789473684,"fineweb_edu":[1.8126533031463623],"modernbert_readability":[-5.71875,-1.1318359375,0.42041015625,0.80908203125,3.443359375,0.47412109375],"qurater":[-2.6953125,0.857421875,0.17431640625,-1.25],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_2gram":2.8169014084507045,"rps_doc_unigram_entropy":4.36775027,"dsir_math":-929.44133967,"dsir_wiki":-906.62001096,"rps_doc_num_sentences":13,"rps_doc_word_count":95.0,"modernbert_professionalism":[-4.3203125,-1.5869140625,0.89990234375,2.951171875,2.283203125,-0.8603515625],"rps_doc_frac_unique_words":85.29411764705883,"fluency_en":[0.0989990234375,-0.252685546875],"rps_doc_frac_no_alph_words":91.1842105263158,"dsir_books":-910.70660294,"modernbert_cleanliness":[-8.1015625,-7.421875,1.353515625,1.6845703125,7.171875,-1.1298828125],"rps_lines_uppercase_letter_fraction":40.04775916707061,"modernbert_reasoning":[-4.22265625,4.37890625,4.828125,0.83447265625,-1.6181640625,-3.162109375],"rps_doc_frac_chars_top_3gram":0,"rps_lines_ending_with_terminal_punctution_mark":70.0,"rps_lines_numerical_chars_fraction":1.077975787653207,"sub_path":"","_source_domain":"wikipedia","_so